{"id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-successor-function.md","title":"Successor Function $S$","display":"df-successor-function — Successor Function $S$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-successor-function","aliases":["92-df-successor-function"],"display":"df-successor-function — Successor Function $S$","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-successor-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-successor-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-successor-function — Successor Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (natural number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (definition-target successor function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function} \\vdash S\\coloneqq(n\\mapsto n+1):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function} \\vdash S\\coloneqq(n\\mapsto n+1):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> : 后继函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(n) = n + 1\">\\(S(n) = n + 1\\)</span></li>\n<li>后继函数是原始递归的基本函数</li>\n<li>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是元层数值函数；系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中同名的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是语法 token，其结构解释在标准模型中取此函数</li>\n<li>numeral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n} = S^n(0)\">\\(\\bar{n} = S^n(0)\\)</span>由后继函数构造</li>\n<li>后继函数在PA中有公理：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;(S(x) \\neq 0)\">\\(\\forall x\\;(S(x) \\neq 0)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"n \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function} \\vdash S\\coloneqq(n\\mapsto n+1):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S(n) = n + 1","display":false},{"tex":"S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{n} = S^n(0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;(S(x) \\neq 0)","display":false}],"bytes":883,"backlinks":[{"id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ (successor function, see [[92-df-successor-function]])"},{"id":"6fb25d603f77631d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z,S,P_1^1$ (basic primitive-recursive functions, see [[92-df-zero-function]], [[92-df-successor-function]], [[92-df-projection-function]])"},{"id":"4ead54d85f5ad67d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ (successor function, see [[92-df-successor-function]])"},{"id":"326ba319ed196f03","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,Z=Z_1$ (successor and unary zero functions, see [[92-df-successor-function]] and [[92-df-zero-function]]